All you need is a free turn after getting adjacent. Sufficient
speed (primarily from boots) is necessary[*]. When you have
got that free turn you can just try to enter the quest leaders
square (while not confirming the "attack him?" dialogue). After
that he will wander around. I use that method occasionally if I
want access to the spot where the quest leader stands; a chest,
a throne, etc. (The quest leader will not wander around if you
just approach and make the talk with him.)

